abstract: "End-to-End International Basketball Analytics System covering 20 years of official FIBA tournaments (1,145 games, 27,353 player boxscores). Combines DuckDB OLAP infrastructure, calibrated LightGBM machine learning in 17 walk-forward folds, non-parametric R statistics, and tactical decision support for coaching staffs."
